('caption', '<b>Figure 2.</b> D335 retains two positive finite growth estimates. Left: twenty 250,000-step windows after 100,000 warm-up steps. Right: means and full measurement-window ranges for the long run, independent 70/90-digit stage implementations and actual SciPy states. Ranges are not confidence intervals.'),
