('caption', '<b>Figure 4.</b> Two declared damping slices at the D335 relative tolerance, each with 257 fresh starts. Left: all 2,048 retained late velocities per setting; no tail points are dropped. Right: means and full ranges of twenty finite windows for the first two directions. Dashed vertical lines mark the original setting. This is a finite numerical diagram, not a certified bifurcation classification.'),
