('p', 'The archive verifier checks file hashes, declared classifications, every displayed summary, determinant identities, independent positive windows and rendering point counts. The exact symbolic audit derives the method polynomials and checks the rational certificates. Neither verifier proves an asymptotic strange attractor or historical priority. Prior-paper PDFs are not redistributed.'),
